Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.96,0:00:28.32,Thought,,0,0,0,,The breeze had started to turn chilly, and fallen leaves are now crunching beneath our feet.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.32,0:00:33.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,Around that time every year, Kaoru-san's little sisters would come to visit Sazanami again.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.04,0:00:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're home!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.91,0:00:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Nami!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.99,0:01:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, Mio-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.59,0:01:01.80,Thought,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.96,0:01:04.65,Thought,,0,0,0,,This is Nami-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.65,0:01:09.95,Thought,,0,0,0,,She's Kaoru-san's little sister, and she's working hard to become a proper shrine maiden. {miko = miko; shrine maiden; young girl or woman (trad. an unmarried virgin) who assists priests at shrines​}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.47,0:01:14.22,Thought,,0,0,0,,And this is Kuon-chan, \Nthe pet Nami-chan keeps.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.22,0:01:17.10,Thought,,0,0,0,,She's become great friends with Tora-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.05,0:01:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.65,0:01:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna try too!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.05,0:01:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.53,0:01:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kids sure are carefree, aren't they?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.02,0:01:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.53,0:01:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you cold?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm dressed like this all year round.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.78,0:01:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right... Still, I don't think that's appropriate \Nin front of other people.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.02,0:01:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... You're saying \Nthe same thing Kanzaki does.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.74,0:01:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.30,0:01:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.45,0:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-chan, you oughta take life a little easier.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.81,0:01:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you feel really good.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.02,0:02:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanzaki. You're back.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:02.76,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you trying to do to my cousin?!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.92,0:02:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothin'...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-san, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.95,0:02:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Wow!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.89,0:02:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A true bare-handed catch! {shirahadori = stopping a sword stroke between one's bare hands}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.65,0:02:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing, Mayuki-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.51,0:02:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right... Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.98,0:02:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-san, don't encourage her.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.78,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.70,0:02:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.95,0:02:21.56,Thought,,0,0,0,,This is Hayumi-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.56,0:02:27.08,Thought,,0,0,0,,She's Kaoru-san's cousin, and despite her looks she's a skilled archer competing in nationals. { kyudo; Japanese archery}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.08,0:02:29.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,She's here because \Nthere's a tournament nearby,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.48,0:02:32.59,Thought,,0,0,0,,and she brought Nami-chan \Nand Kuon-chan along to visit.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! So good, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.10,0:02:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing for me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.67,0:02:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it too!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.90,0:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-chan, watch out!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.82,0:02:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.67,0:02:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.27,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.03,0:02:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nami-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.64,0:02:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.64,0:03:00.14,Thought,,0,0,0,,Everyone was having a wonderful time \Nlike this... until she arrived.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry for keeping you waiting.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.64,0:03:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Sazanami Girls' Dorm, correct?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kanzaki Kaede.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.88,0:03:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.59,0:03:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please give this to Kanzaki Kaoru, \Nwho's staying here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.45,0:03:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.41,0:03:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.15,0:03:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.95,0:03:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you one of Kaoru-san's relatives?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.85,0:03:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm her cousin.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.58,0:03:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-san's already home. \NShall I go get her?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.40,0:03:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.32,0:03:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.81,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-chan? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.50,0:03:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-san! \NKaede-chan's here!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.26,0:03:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hayumi-san's here too?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.87,0:03:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.26,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Kaede-chan! \NWhat brings you here?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.70,0:03:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master asked me to deliver something. {master/boss/artisan - prolly the boss of the dojo of whatever martial art she's doing?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.34,0:03:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.51,0:03:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.22,0:04:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master sent you with the talisman? \NThanks for bringing it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.49,0:04:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.68,0:04:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be tired. \NStay and rest for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.19,0:04:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan's staying over!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.07,0:04:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's Kaede-chan for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.97,0:04:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Kaoru-chan and me, she's one of the successors to the Kanzaki school's mystical arts.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.62,0:04:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? So does Kaede-chan swing a sword around with a {\i1}kiyaa{\i0} like Kaoru-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.04,0:04:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Unlike Kaoru, \NI mainly use these Nagisa shortswords. {渚小太刀 - doesn't seem like it exists irl?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.14,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I exorcise monsters and dispel curses swiftly with them. That's my style.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.48,0:04:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.98,0:04:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Kaede's still \Nonly a successor candidate.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.73,0:04:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Real assignments are probably still \Na little early for Kaede-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.11,0:04:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what exactly \Ndo you inherit as a successor?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.15,0:05:01.61,Top,,0,0,0,,A fighting style. I inherited two-handed Itto-ryu\Nfencing, which uses a long sword.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.12,0:05:05.36,Top,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-san inherited Shinmei-ryu, \Nwhich uses the bow.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.92,0:05:10.28,Top,,0,0,0,,Kaede inherited Fugetsu-ryu, \Nwhich uses short swords.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.41,0:05:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami's studying Itto-ryu too, \Nbut she's still an apprentice.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.88,0:05:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so you've all been \Ntraining since you were little?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.88,0:05:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really. Those two used to be the best partners in crime when they were kids.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.70,0:05:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did we?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.66,0:05:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru was always dragging me into it. {refers to herself with "uchi" - not sure how that characterizes her, probably as socially awkward and old-fashioned? or overly formal? anyway quirky speech pattern}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.73,0:05:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? You looked like you were having fun too!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! I always protested it 'till the bitter end!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.28,0:05:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it now. \NYou two really {\i1}do{\i0} make quite the team.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.52,0:05:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It shows that you've \Nbeen friends since forever.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We are {\i1}not{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.66,0:05:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's show time! {??????????? subdesu has "Look out for the submarine!"; maybe something like "I can hold my breath for super long!"}{it's ショータイム}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.77,0:05:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{nyanda - perfectly meaningless}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.98,0:06:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing, Mio-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.68,0:06:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan, want me to wash your back?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No thanks. I can do that myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.10,0:06:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{alley hop}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.21,0:06:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan, want me to wash your back?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.46,0:06:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But first I need to wash this little one.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.61,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.68,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go. Good girl. \NLet's get you all nice and clean.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.42,0:06:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Kaoru-chan! That scar...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.65,0:06:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I got it during my last assignment.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.54,0:06:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan... aren't you pushing yourself too hard?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.55,0:06:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-san, it's only because \NI'm still not good enough. {also uchi now?}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.66,0:07:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.59,0:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaoru, how about a match?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.12,0:07:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'll get the wooden swords.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.87,0:07:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.21,0:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a real match.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.13,0:07:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.45,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. We're not children anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.36,0:07:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.68,0:07:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, here I come!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.03,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.76,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kosuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.50,0:07:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.87,0:07:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Kaoru and Kaede-chan \Nare having a match with real swords.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.59,0:08:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiritual Manifestation — Kanzaki Fugetsu-ryu! {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.55,0:08:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.68,0:08:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Will!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame Burst! {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.91,0:08:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've learned some impressive techniques.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.22,0:08:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive. \NI couldn't do that much when I was your age.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.34,0:08:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.48,0:08:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.00,0:08:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why won't you fight me seriously?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.44,0:08:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.43,0:08:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep telling me that, and yet...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.61,0:08:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never know my sorrows! {?????????}{嬉しくないや; she's not happy about not being truly recognized by her sister}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.98,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.86,0:08:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.67,0:08:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.45,0:09:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan was crying.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.37,0:09:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kaoru-chan's fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.12,0:09:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My fault?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.65,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it Kaoru-san's fault?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.11,0:09:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Kaoru-chan treated \NKaede-chan like a child.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.24,0:09:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh... all I did was give her a match...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.90,0:09:25.39,Overlap,,0,0,0,,You can't really call that a match.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say you just toyed with her. {????}{遇た}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.30,0:09:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.82,0:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that something you already \Nknow better than anyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... I...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.22,0:09:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.48,0:09:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.86,0:09:48.39,Thought,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.53,0:09:54.29,Thought,,0,0,0,,You really haven't changed. You've always tried to carry everything by yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.55,0:10:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.41,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm sure you \Ncould've gone out with everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.77,0:10:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.43,0:10:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... sorry if I'm being too nosy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.78,0:10:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.69,0:10:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I need to bring in the laundry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.96,0:10:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's fine. Just relax and watch TV.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.57,0:10:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.98,0:10:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:46.04,0:10:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Yes, this is Kanzaki speaking...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.22,0:10:54.22,Thought,,0,0,0,,This is a request for one of Kaoru's exorcism jobs.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew... finished.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.85,0:11:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan, want to come \Ngrocery shopping for dinner with me?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.87,0:11:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.83,0:11:21.37,Thought,,0,0,0,,An exorcism of a demon in an old well... {退治}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.83,0:11:24.83,Thought,,0,0,0,,That's it. The seal's starting to weaken.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.34,0:11:28.79,Thought,,0,0,0,,If it lives in some old well like that, \Nit can't be all that.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.79,0:11:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right... I'll do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.98,0:11:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't come out... Did I fail?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.03,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,T-This thing...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.86,0:11:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not an ordinary spirit. It's a wrath! {tatari = curse; divine punishment; wrath (of an angry spirit)}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.00,0:12:08.87,Thought,,0,0,0,,If I destroy this thing... \Nthen even Kaoru will have to admit...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.26,0:12:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I can do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.74,0:12:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiritual Manifestation — Kanzaki Fugetsu-ryu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.51,0:12:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Art: Purifying Blade! {????????????? }{神技 閃流刃}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.19,0:12:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! I exorcised it!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.84,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can do it if I try!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This sweet potato is delicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.33,0:12:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And these marrons glacés too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.75,0:12:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.75,0:12:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san, you're an amazing cook. \NThis cheesecake is incredible too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.22,0:12:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.57,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.35,0:13:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That wound on your neck...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.48,0:13:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.23,0:13:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kosuke-san! Is there any cake left? \NI'd like another piece.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.76,0:13:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Sure. I'll go get some.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.38,0:13:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-kun, I want some too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.28,0:13:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.92,0:13:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.88,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.57,0:13:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I want another piece too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.18,0:13:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.25,0:13:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then me too.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.57,0:13:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.00,0:13:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke-san, more cake for everyone, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.88,0:13:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.04,0:13:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Kosuke, and another beer!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.55,0:13:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.79,0:13:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kaoru, there's some cake for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.16,0:13:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.55,0:13:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuki-san, you're a manga artist, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.17,0:13:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.10,0:13:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.68,0:13:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Sazanami Girls' Dorm.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.78,0:13:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? About that exorcism earlier?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.38,0:13:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A petite girl came by this evening...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.53,0:14:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.55,0:14:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... No... Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.62,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for letting me know.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.99,0:14:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you all waiting!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:10.83,0:14:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We've been waiting!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.19,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru, your cake... What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.08,0:14:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's eat over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.80,0:14:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's your favorite strawberry cake... \NHuh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.95,0:14:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.05,0:14:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing this evening?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.61,0:14:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh... you mean the job? \NI took care of it for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to thank...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.96,0:14:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.57,0:14:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.18,0:14:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you take that job without permission?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.08,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Hayumi-san were both out, \Nand I couldn't reach you...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.12,0:14:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what cell phones are for!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.04,0:14:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But I defeated it...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.32,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make excuses!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.46,0:14:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Exorcism work isn't something to take lightly!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.99,0:15:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What would've happened if something had gone wrong?! You could've died!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm an exorcist from the Kanzaki family too!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.77,0:15:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too soon for you \Nto be taking assignments!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.18,0:15:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's done is done, \Nbut don't ever do this again!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.76,0:15:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You always do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.15,0:15:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.92,0:15:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always treating me like a worthless child!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.23,0:15:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a half-baked nobody!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.34,0:15:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.66,0:15:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.54,0:15:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.26,0:15:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the half-baked one.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.41,0:15:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! \NStupid idiot Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.68,0:15:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:53.27,0:15:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This place?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.11,0:15:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The old well... {It's where I exorcised that old well wrath earlier}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.70,0:16:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But I already exorcised it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.34,0:16:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.13,0:16:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.09,0:16:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.64,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried. \NI know I went a little too far earlier.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.60,0:16:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.77,0:16:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.59,0:16:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede, what are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.62,0:16:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been possessed!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.08,0:17:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Kaede, what are you...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My body... won't move...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.18,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.07,0:17:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You smell so nice... {figures}{my dick is so hard man, I love yuri incest age gap}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.31,0:17:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.11,0:17:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arms... your hands... your fingers...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I love all of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.29,0:17:28.02,Thought,,0,0,0,,She's completely under its control.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.02,0:17:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make you feel even better, Kaoru.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.12,0:17:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru... can I tell you something?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.46,0:17:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always admired you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.17,0:17:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to become someone \Nwho defeats demons the way you do.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.60,0:17:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never could.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.35,0:17:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to become stronger \Nand defeat monsters and wraiths...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.31,0:18:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.67,0:18:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You want to become \Na true successor that badly?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.58,0:18:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I became the successor when I was seven.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.74,0:18:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not long before that, \Na terrifying wraith appeared
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.83,0:18:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and ravaged the whole area!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.45,0:18:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, Hayumi-san, \Nyou, and I were all still children,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.05,0:18:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,so my grandmother \Nand Hayumi's grandmother, Ayumi-san,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.60,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,were the ones who confronted it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.43,0:18:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But the wraith was too powerful, \Nand they... couldn't seal it away.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:50.49,0:18:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,A-And then... the wraith devoured Ayumi-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.74,0:18:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and left my grandmother bedridden.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.50,0:19:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,At that time, the one I sealed away \Nwith Izayoi's help... was Kuon. {?????? this entire retarded loredump flies way above my head just as much as the lore itself is retarded; kuon is the pet kitten of nami kanzaki (the loli), izayoi is the spirit living in kaoru's sword}{same, this mid-sex infodump is really fucking bad}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.58,0:19:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So if Kuon ever became a wraith again...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.59,0:19:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,even if Nami hated me for it...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.55,0:19:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.43,0:19:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd cut Kuon down!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.18,0:19:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,If I didn't, even more people would suffer.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.06,0:19:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But that thankless duty... \Nit's enough for me to bear alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.54,0:19:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you walking \Nthe same painful road I have.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet... Even so...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.45,0:19:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'd only be a burden to you, Kaoru...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.16,0:19:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I want to walk the same path as you!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.25,0:19:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ka... e... de...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.48,0:20:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.34,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.11,0:20:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You passed out.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.50,0:20:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Kaoru?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.45,0:20:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She went after the escaped wraith. \NWe're heading there now.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.55,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.60,0:20:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.25,0:20:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.40,0:20:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take me...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.61,0:20:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.63,0:20:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Kanzaki too!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.64,0:21:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.79,0:21:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to see it? {???? sound like "can't bear to watch it?"}{it is }
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.17,0:21:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.45,0:21:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no, every one of Kanzaki's successors has fought like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.88,0:21:23.22,Thought,,0,0,0,,Even if Nami hated me for it, \NI'd cut Kuon down!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.22,0:21:26.35,Thought,,0,0,0,,That thankless duty \Nis enough for me to bear alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.16,0:21:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Exorcism work is painful, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.10,0:21:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I was born into the Kanzaki family.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.49,0:21:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiritual Manifestation! \NKanzaki Shinmei-ryu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:39.53,0:21:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine Will!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.26,0:21:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterlife Volley! {楽葬矢?}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:50.92,0:21:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hayumi-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.30,0:21:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:58.18,0:21:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,has it calmed down?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:12.15,0:22:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.90,0:22:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru! Let me help you!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.53,0:22:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't be a burden!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.33,0:22:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Kaede! Let's go!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.61,0:22:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiritual Manifestation!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.11,0:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki Itto-ryu!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.44,0:22:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanzaki Fugetsu-ryu!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.15,0:22:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Divine...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:42.05,0:22:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Technique...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.01,0:22:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Purification Beam! {?????????????}{治攻弾 I guess; convinced all attack names are made up in this}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.03,0:23:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you all so much for everything.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.95,0:23:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come visit again!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.51,0:23:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.23,0:23:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, you're leaving already?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.81,0:23:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:54.70,0:23:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.24,0:23:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.84,0:24:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Nami-chan \Nand the others will come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:01.70,0:24:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.19,0:24:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.92,0:24:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mio-chan, I promise we'll come back.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:07.61,0:24:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's pinky swear.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.08,0:24:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.23,0:24:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,tell the Master I said hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.87,0:24:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.01,0:24:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:19.94,0:24:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.98,0:24:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll fight you seriously.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.06,0:24:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:23.82,0:24:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And next time I come, \NI'll be much, much stronger!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.50,0:24:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I'll be looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.96,0:25:20.81,Thought,,0,0,0,,And with that, \NHayumi-san and the others went home.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.92,0:25:28.25,Thought,,0,0,0,,Nami-chan tried her hardest not to burst into tears.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.72,0:25:33.38,Thought,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan wore the most \Nwonderful smile I'd ever seen.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:34.10,0:25:35.37,Thought,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:35.77,0:25:37.35,Thought,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:37.35,0:25:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:41.31,0:25:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Chika-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:43.77,0:25:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:45.22,0:25:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Has your fever gone down?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:46.43,0:25:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's gone. \NI'll be able to go to school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.50,0:25:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great. \NHey, I bought some cake. Let's eat it.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:53.22,0:25:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:53.81,0:25:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I got your favorite.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:56.06,0:25:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.42,0:25:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come downstairs then.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.67,0:25:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.75,0:26:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I brought cake!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:02.87,0:26:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{??? tanoshi?}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:04.21,0:26:09.19,Thought,,0,0,0,,That's right. Kaede-chan enrolled \Nat the same school as us.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.19,0:26:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Kaede back already?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:10.67,0:26:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaoru!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:12.41,0:26:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.01,0:26:17.95,Top,,0,0,0,,{something about buying cake? and souka}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.27,0:26:18.97,Thought,,0,0,0,,Kaede-chan seems happy to be with Kaoru-san and looks like she's having a great time.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:18.97,0:26:24.48,Thought,,0,0,0,,Chika has also become friends with Kaede-chan \Nand is having a lot of fun right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:29.82,0:26:31.88,Thought,,0,0,0,,Happy end.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.49,0:26:58.43,Song,,0,0,0,,{Kaze ni Makenai Heart no Katachi by Nishimura Hina ; full lyrics: https://utaten.com/lyric/to16064644/ - copied from episode 1}I've counted all the days\NFrom sunny afternoons to starry nights
Dialogue: 10,0:26:58.90,0:27:04.54,Song,,0,0,0,,Even through the saddest mornings\NYou always smiled
Dialogue: 10,0:27:04.97,0:27:10.18,Song,,0,0,0,,And gave me a gentle melody
Dialogue: 10,0:27:10.18,0:27:12.01,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart
Dialogue: 10,0:27:12.01,0:27:16.52,Song,,0,0,0,,Remember the blueness of the sky
Dialogue: 10,0:27:17.95,0:27:22.59,Song,,0,0,0,,Even when your eyes fill with tears
Dialogue: 10,0:27:22.59,0:27:24.26,Song,,0,0,0,,Feeling Heart
Dialogue: 10,0:27:24.26,0:27:36.54,Song,,0,0,0,,We made a promise with our hearts as one\NAnd we've finally made it this far
Dialogue: 10,0:27:37.14,0:27:43.18,Song,,0,0,0,,Our hearts are always sincere, always unbeatable
Dialogue: 10,0:27:43.18,0:27:49.52,Song,,0,0,0,,This feeling I hold close isn't the biggest or the strongest
Dialogue: 10,0:27:49.52,0:27:55.56,Song,,0,0,0,,But it's a heart that won't lose to the wind
Dialogue: 10,0:27:55.56,0:28:01.76,Song,,0,0,0,,Those sleepless nights I spent crying\NWill surely become my strength
Dialogue: 10,0:28:01.76,0:28:07.94,Song,,0,0,0,,That's what a heart is, absolutely unbeatable!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.13,0:28:07.40,Song,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H630967&}Absolutely!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:07.94,0:28:17.01,Song,,0,0,0,,Let's keep smiling as we walk into the wind
Dialogue: 10,0:28:17.01,0:28:25.69,Song,,0,0,0,,We won't lose! Our hearts...
Dialogue: 10,0:28:25.69,0:28:26.42,Song,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H630967&}OK!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:26.42,0:28:35.66,Song,,0,0,0,,...are unbeatable!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.36,0:28:35.66,Song,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H630967&}(Of course they are!)
Comment: 0,0:28:35.66,0:28:38.66,Song,,0,0,0,,
